000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.          SIRMAIN.
000400 AUTHOR.              C HILLES.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.        7/1/83.
000600 DATE-COMPILED.
000700*INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
000800*SECURITY.
000900*REMARKS.
001000**************************************************************
001100**   ON ALL STORES PGMS EXCEPT THE INQUIRY, 'f1' AND 'f2'   **
001200**   LET YOU GO TO ISSUES MENU OR RETURNS MENU.  IF JCW WAS **
001300**   0, ("SW" UDC WAS USED), 'f8' RETURNS TO AN INTERMEDIATE**
001400**   ISSUE & RETURN SCREEN, OTHERWISE,IF SW1, SW2, ... ST4  **
001500**   WAS USED, 'f8' ENDS ENTIRE PROGRAM.  IF PREVIOUSLY IN  **
001600**   INQUIRY, 'f8' RETURNS TO ISSUE MENU.                   **
001700**************************************************************
001800**  EACH SUBPGM ALLOWS THE USER TO GO TO AN INTERMEDIATE    **
001900**  SCREEN.  F1 BRINGS THEM TO AN INTERMEDIATE SCREEN OF    **
002000**  ISSUE PROGRAMS, ALLOWING THEM TO GO DIRECTLY TO ANY     **
002100**  ISSUE PGM (SW1 THRU SW4).  F2 BRINGS THEM TO A RET INT. **
002200**  SCREEN.  WHEN F1 OR F2 IS HIT, THE SUBPROGRAM RETURNS,  **
002300**  AND THIS ROUTINE IS CALLED TO SELECT THE PGM.           **
002400**************************************************************
002500*D   THIS IS THE "MAIN" SUBPROGRAM THAT CALLS ALL THE
002600*D   STOREROOM ISSUE/RETURN PROGRAMS.
002700*    ON NOVEMBER 30, 1983, CHANGED PARAMETERS FOR CALL TO
002800*    "TSPLPRT".  NOW RETURNS ENTIRE SPOOLER REC, BUT NO
002900*    MESSAGE BUFFER.  CIH.
003000*
003100*    ON APRIL 26, 1984, MADE THE FOLLOWING CHANGES:
003200*    1. CHANGED PARAMETERS FOR CALLS TO STORES SUBPROGRAMS
003300*       (TIRSNGL, TIRWSBLD, TIRWSMOD, AND TIRWSOK) TO INCLUDE
003400*       SPOOLER REC (USER, ACCOUNT, TERM NUMBER, AND ALL 5 SPOOLER
003500*       NUMBERS), RATHER THAN JUST SPOOL-PRT.  THIS IS BECAUSE THE
003600*       5TH SPOOLER NUMBER WAS USED TO DETERMINE WHETHER HALF-SHEET,
003700*       PAPER WAS BEING USED, BUT THIS KEY WAS LOST WHEN GOING
003800*       BETWEEN SUB-PROGRAMS.  CIH.
003900*
004000*    ON JUNE 1, 1984, FIXED ILLEGAL ASCII DIGIT PROBLEM.
004100*    THIS OCCURED WHEN THE USER WENT TO MATERIAL STATUS
004200*    INQUIRY AND DID A SCREEN PRINT.  FIXED BY CORRECTING
004300*    THE PARAMETER TO THE CALL TO BE "S9(2) COMP" INSTEAD
004400*    OF "9(2)".  CIH.
004500*
004600*    ON SEPT 10, 1984, MADE THE FOLLOWING CHANGES:
004700*      1.  TOOK OUT KSAM WORK AREA IN THE WORKING STORAGE SECTION.
004800*          THIS WAS NO LONGER NEEDED.
004900*
005000*      2.  TOOK OUT THE BLOWUP IF THE JCW "STORES" IS NOT FOUND.
005100*          INSTEAD, IF NO JCW IS FOUND, THE VALUE 1 (ISSUE SINGLE)
005200*          IS DEFAULT.
005300*
005400*    ON JANUARY 21, 1985, ADDED A DUMMY PARAMETER TO THE CALL
005500*    OF THE SUBPROGRAM "TMTLSTAT" - MATERIAL STATUS INQUIRY.
005600*    THIS IS A DUMMY CORPORATE CODE PARAMETER - USED BY PROGRAMS
005700*    THAT MAY PASS THE CORP CODE TO THE INQUIRY, THUS BYPASSING
005800*    THE CORPORATE CODE ENTRY SCREEN.  IF THE PASSED CODE IS SPACES,
005900*    THE CODE ENTRY SCREEN IS BROUGHT, AND THE CODE PARAMETER IS
006000*    IGNORED.  CIH.
006100*
006200*    ON JANUARY 23, 1985, CHANGED THE "K-TERMINAL" PARAMETER
006300*    (THE TERMINAL NUMBER OBTAINED FROM "TSPLPRT", WHICH IS PASSED
006400*    BACK AND FORTH TO "TIRMAIN") FROM 9(2) TO 9(4).  CIH.
006500*
006600*   10/ 8/85  ADDED CALLS TO FINDJCW, NLAPPEND, CATOPEN, AND *
006700*             CATCLOSE IN ORDER TO ACCOMODATE THE NATIVE     *
006800*             LANGUAGE SUPPORT FACILITY.  ADDED LINKAGES AND *
006900*             ALSO MADE THE CHANGE TO THE FORMFILE NAMES.    *
007000*             CHANGED ALL REFERENCES OF TSCRPRNT TO TSCRPRT2,*
007100*             TDATECHK TO TDATECK2.                          *
007200*             THIS WAS TO INCORPORATE THE NATIVE LANGUAGE    *
007300*             SUPPORT VERSIONS OF THESE SUBROUTINES.         *
007400*                                          PD RAGLOW         *
007500**************************************************************
007600*
007700*
007800*    02/12/86.
007900*      CHANGED THIS PROGRAM TO A SUBPROGRAM SO IT CAN BE CALLED
008000*      FROM THE NEW STORES EXECUTIVE PROGRAM "TUDCSTR".  CIH.
008100*
008200 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
008300 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
008400 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
008500 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
008600 COPY SPECIALN     IN COPYLIB.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZUDCSTR-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.

008800 DATA DIVISION.
008900 FILE SECTION.
009000
009100*------ FD STATEMENT AREA FOR IBM ONLY ------*
009200 FD  DISPLAY-FILE
009300     LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
009400 01  DISPLAY-REC          PIC X(2000).
009500*------ FD STATEMENT AREA FOR IBM ONLY ------*
009600
009700 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
009800
009900 77  SAVE-LASTKEY                 PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 0.
010000 COPY FUNCTDEF   IN COPYLIB.
010100
010200**************************************************************
010300**                                                          **
010400**          S U B P R O G R A M   A R E A S                 **
010500**                                                          **
010600**************************************************************
010700
010800 COPY TBLOWUP    IN COPYLIB.
010900 COPY CSWITCHF   IN COPYLIB.
011000 COPY CATREAD    IN COPYLIB.
011100 COPY DISPDAT2   IN COPYLIB.
011200 COPY IOFEEDBACK OF COPYLIB.
011300 01  SPOOL-STAT-DUMMY             PIC S9 COMP VALUE 0.
011400 01  RET-CODE                     PIC X(2)  VALUE SPACES.
011500*----------- DUMMY CODE PARAMETER FOR CALL TO "TMTLSTAT
011600 01  DUMMY-CODE-PARM               PIC X(7)  VALUE SPACES.
011700
011800**************************************************************
011900**                                                          **
012000**                  V I E W   W O R K                       **
012100**                                                          **
012200**************************************************************
012300
012400 01  DE-FIELDS-1        PIC X(2000).
012500 01  DE-MESSAGE-LINE-1            PIC X.
012600 01  MESSAGE-BUFFER.
012700     05  MSG-TEXT.
012800         10 MESSAGE-BUFFER-1  PIC X     VALUE SPACES.
012900         10 FILLER            PIC X(67) VALUE SPACES.
013000     05  MSG-FLD          PIC X(8)   VALUE SPACES.
013100     05  MSG-FLD-9 REDEFINES MSG-FLD PIC ZZZZZZZ9.
013200
013300 01  MSG-BUFFLEN          PIC S9(4)  COMP VALUE 76.
013400 01  MSG-ACTUALEN         PIC S9(4)  COMP VALUE 76.
013500
013600 01  FORMFILE.
013700     05  FORM-FNAME                PIC X(8)  VALUE "FUDCSTR".
013800     05  FILLER                    PIC X     VALUE ".".
013900     05  FORM-GNAME.
014000         10  FORM-GNAME1           PIC X(5)  VALUE "FLANG".
014100         10  FORM-GNAME2           PIC X(3)  VALUE SPACES.
014200     05  FILLER                    PIC X(19) VALUE SPACES.
014300
014400 01  FIELD-NUMBER         PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 1.
014500 01  NUMBER-OF-FORMS      PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 21.
014600
014700 01  STATUS-AREA.
014800     05  COND-WORD              PIC S9(4) VALUE ZEROS   COMP.
014900     05  DATA-LENG              PIC S9(4) VALUE ZEROS   COMP.
015000     05  RCD-NO                 PIC S9(9) VALUE ZEROS   COMP.
015100     05  CHAIN-LENG             PIC S9(9) VALUE ZEROS   COMP.
015200     05  BKWD-ADDR              PIC S9(9) VALUE ZEROS   COMP.
015300     05  FWRD-ADDR              PIC S9(9) VALUE ZEROS   COMP.
015400
015500**************************************************************
015600**                                                          **
015700**         L I N K A G E   S E C T I O N                    **
015800**                                                          **
015900**************************************************************
016000
016100 LINKAGE SECTION.
016200 01  BASE                          PIC X(10).
016300 01  MMIS-BASE                     PIC X(20).
016400 COPY VCOMLINK IN COPYLIB.
016500 COPY LANGSUB  IN COPYLIB.
016600 COPY STCOM    IN COPYLIB.
016700 COPY TSHWSUB  IN COPYLIB.
016800 COPY ESCNAME  IN COPYLIB.
016900
017000*---------- MULTIPLE STOREROOM PARMS
017100 01  MULTIPLE-STR-DATA.
017200     05  MULT-STR-STR.
017300         10  MULT-STR-STR-1        PIC X(1).
017400         10  MULT-STR-STR-2        PIC X(1).
017500     05  MULT-STR-FLAG             PIC X(1).
017600         88  MULT-STR-PLANT        VALUE "Y".
017700     05  ALWAYS-MULT-STR-CODE-FLAG PIC X(1).
017800         88  ALWAYS-MULT-STR-CODE  VALUE "Y".
017900     05  FILLER                    PIC X(40).
018000
018100
018200 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BASE, MMIS-BASE, VIEW-COMAREA,
018300       LANGUAGE-PARMS, STORES-COMAREA, SRF-COMAREA,
018400       SRF-SPOOLER-REC, ESC-NAME, MULTIPLE-STR-DATA.
018500
018600 MAINLINE-LOGIC.
018700
018800     PERFORM 9999-OPEN-STUFF.
018900
           MOVE "N" TO CSF-OPENFORM-ERR-SW.
019000*
019100* CALL INITIAL SUBPROGRAM
019200*
019300     PERFORM 5-CALL-PROGRAM.
019400     MOVE 4 TO SRF-KEYSET.
019500     PERFORM UNTIL VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL EXIT-PROGRAM
019600
019700       PERFORM 6-GET-MENU-SELECTION
019800
019900*
020000* HANDLE F6-KEY - TOGGLE BETWEEN ISSUES/RETURNS MENU
020100*
020200       PERFORM UNTIL VIEW-LASTKEY NOT EQUAL F6-KEY
020300
020400         IF SAVE-LASTKEY EQUAL F1-KEY
020500           MOVE F2-KEY TO VIEW-LASTKEY
020600         ELSE
020700           MOVE F1-KEY TO VIEW-LASTKEY
020800         END-IF
020900         PERFORM 6-GET-MENU-SELECTION
021000
021100       END-PERFORM
021200
021300*
021400* SET SCOM-PGM-KEY AND CALL APPROPRIATE PROGRAM
021500* IGNORE PRINT SCREEN - TSHWRDFM HANDLES ON HP - DOESN'T FUNCTION ON
021600* IBM
021700*
021800       IF ( VIEW-LASTKEY NOT EQUAL EXIT-PROGRAM  ) AND
021900          ( VIEW-LASTKEY NOT EQUAL F5-KEY        )
022000         PERFORM 7-SET-PROGRAM-KEY
022100         PERFORM 5-CALL-PROGRAM
022200         MOVE 4 TO SRF-KEYSET
022300       END-IF
022400
022500*
022600* CALLED PROGRAM ONLY RETURNS F1-KEY, F2-KEY OR EXIT-PROGRAM
022700* SO IF EQUALS F5-KEY HERE THEN USER PRESSED F5-KEY ON ISSUES/RETURNS
022800* MENU SO RESET TO SAVE-LASTKEY F1-KEY OR F2-KEY FOR WHICH MENU
022900* IS CURRENLY DISPLAYED
023000*
023100       IF VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL F5-KEY
023200         MOVE SAVE-LASTKEY TO VIEW-LASTKEY
023300       END-IF
023400
023500     END-PERFORM.
023600*
023700* CLOSE FILES AND EXIT
023800*
023900     PERFORM 9999-CLOSE-STUFF.
024000     GOBACK.
024100
024200**************************************************************
024300* PARAGRAPH : 2100-BLOWUP                                    *
024400* PURPOSE   : TO BLOWUP THE PROGRAM AND WRITE TO BLOWUP RPT  *
024500**************************************************************
024600 2100-BLOWUP.
024700     MOVE "SIRMAIN"                TO   BU-PGM-NAME.
024800     CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE BU-PGM-NAME STATUS-AREA
024900       VIEW-COMAREA DUMMY-KSAM-STAT BU-DISPLAY-MSG
025000       BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
025100
025200**************************************************************
025300* PARAGRAPH : 4-CLEAR-FORM                                   *
025400* PURPOSE   : CLEAR THE ISSUES/RETURNS MENU.  THESE FORMS DO *
025500*             NOT HAVE ANY INPUT FIELDS.                     *
025600**************************************************************
025700 4-CLEAR-FORM.
025800     MOVE SPACES TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.
025900     PERFORM 9999-PUTWINDOW.
026000     PERFORM 9999-INITFORM.
026100
026200**************************************************************
026300* PARAGRAPH : 5-CALL-PROGRAM                                 *
026400* PURPOSE   : CALL REQUESTED PROGRAM BASED ON SCOM-PGM-KEY   *
026500**************************************************************
026600 5-CALL-PROGRAM.
026700     IF SCOM-PGM-KEY EQUAL "Q1"
026800       PERFORM 8-MATERIAL-STATUS
027000     ELSE IF SCOM-PGM-KEY EQUAL "SW1" OR "ST1"
027100       CALL "TIRSNGL" USING BASE, MMIS-BASE, STATUS-AREA,
027200         VIEW-COMAREA, STORES-COMAREA, SRF-COMAREA,
027300         SRF-SPOOLER-REC, LANGUAGE-PARMS, MULTIPLE-STR-DATA,
027400         ESC-NAME
027500     ELSE IF SCOM-PGM-KEY EQUAL "SW2" OR "ST2"
027600       CALL "TIRWSBLD" USING BASE, MMIS-BASE, STATUS-AREA,
027700         VIEW-COMAREA, STORES-COMAREA, SRF-COMAREA,
027800         SRF-SPOOLER-REC, LANGUAGE-PARMS, MULTIPLE-STR-DATA,
027900         ESC-NAME
028000     ELSE IF SCOM-PGM-KEY EQUAL "SW3" OR "ST3"
028100       CALL "TIRWSMOD" USING BASE, MMIS-BASE, STATUS-AREA,
028200         VIEW-COMAREA, STORES-COMAREA, SRF-COMAREA,
028300         SRF-SPOOLER-REC, LANGUAGE-PARMS, MULTIPLE-STR-DATA,
028400         ESC-NAME
028500     ELSE IF SCOM-PGM-KEY EQUAL "SW4" OR "ST4"
028600       CALL "TIRWSOK" USING BASE, MMIS-BASE, STATUS-AREA,
028700         VIEW-COMAREA, STORES-COMAREA, SRF-COMAREA,
028800         SRF-SPOOLER-REC, LANGUAGE-PARMS, MULTIPLE-STR-DATA,
028900         ESC-NAME.
029000
029100**************************************************************
029200* PARAGRAPH : 6-GET-MENU-SELECTION                           *
029300* PURPOSE   : DISPLAY APPROPRIATE FORM ( ISSUES/RETURNS )    *
029400*             AND READ THAT FORM FOR THE KEY HIT. ALSO       *
029500*             HANDLES INVALID FUNCTION KEYS.                 *
029600**************************************************************
029700 6-GET-MENU-SELECTION.
029800*
029900* DECIDE WHICH FORM TO DISPLAY
030000*
030100     MOVE VIEW-LASTKEY TO SAVE-LASTKEY.
030200     IF SAVE-LASTKEY EQUAL F1-KEY
030300       MOVE "SELECTISS" TO VIEW-NFNAME
030400     ELSE
030500       MOVE "SELECTRET" TO VIEW-NFNAME
030600     END-IF.
030700
030800     PERFORM 9999-GETNEXTFORM.
030900     PERFORM 9999-DO-SCREEN-1.
031000*
031100* READ UNTIL VALID KEY PRESSED
031200*
031300     PERFORM UNTIL VIEW-LASTKEY GREATER THAN 0 AND
031400                   VIEW-LASTKEY LESS THAN 9
031500
031600       PERFORM 9999-DO-SCREEN-1
031700       IF VIEW-LASTKEY LESS THAN 1 OR
031800          VIEW-LASTKEY GREATER THAN 8
031900
032000          MOVE   5 TO LANG-SETNUM
032100          MOVE  28 TO LANG-MSGNUM
032200          PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
032300          PERFORM 9999-PUTWINDOW
032400
032500       END-IF
032600
032700     END-PERFORM.
032800
032900**************************************************************
033000* PARAGRAPH : 7-SET-PROGRAM-KEY                              *
033100* PURPOSE   : SET PARAMETER SCOM-PGM-KEY TO APPROPRIATE      *
033200*             VALUE BASED ON VIEW-LASTKEY AND SAVE-LASTKEY.  *
033300*             SAVE-LASTKEY = F1-KEY - FROM ISSUES            *
033400*             SAVE-LASTKEY = F2-KEY - FROM RETURNS           *
033500**************************************************************
033600 7-SET-PROGRAM-KEY.
033700     EVALUATE VIEW-LASTKEY
033800       WHEN F1-KEY
033900         IF SAVE-LASTKEY = F1-KEY
034000             MOVE "SW1" TO SCOM-PGM-KEY
034100         ELSE
034200             MOVE "ST1" TO SCOM-PGM-KEY
034300         END-IF
034400       WHEN F2-KEY
034500         IF SAVE-LASTKEY = F1-KEY
034600             MOVE "SW2" TO SCOM-PGM-KEY
034700         ELSE
034800             MOVE "ST2" TO SCOM-PGM-KEY
034900         END-IF
035000       WHEN F3-KEY
035100         IF SAVE-LASTKEY = F1-KEY
035200             MOVE "SW3" TO SCOM-PGM-KEY
035300         ELSE
035400             MOVE "ST3" TO SCOM-PGM-KEY
035500         END-IF
035600       WHEN F4-KEY
035700         IF SAVE-LASTKEY = F1-KEY
035800             MOVE "SW4" TO SCOM-PGM-KEY
035900         ELSE
036000             MOVE "ST4" TO SCOM-PGM-KEY
036100         END-IF
036200       WHEN F7-KEY
036300         MOVE "Q1"  TO  SCOM-PGM-KEY
036400       WHEN F8-KEY
036500         IF SAVE-LASTKEY = F1-KEY
036600             MOVE "SW3" TO SCOM-PGM-KEY
036700         ELSE
036800             MOVE "ST3" TO SCOM-PGM-KEY
036900         END-IF
037000     END-EVALUATE.
037100
037200**************************************************************
037300* PARAGRAPH : 8-MATERIAL-STATUS                              *
037400* PURPOSE   : PERFORM MATERIAL STATUS REQUESTS FROM ISSUES/  *
037500*             RETURNS MENU.                                  *
037600**************************************************************
037700 8-MATERIAL-STATUS.
037800*------- SWITCH TO INQUIRY FORMFILE
037900     MOVE "FCSISINQ"               TO   CSF-NEW-FORMFILE-NAME.
038000     MOVE "N"                      TO   CSF-MODE.
038100     PERFORM 9999-CSWITCHF.
038200     IF CSF-OPENFORM-ERR-SW EQUAL "N"
038300
038400*------- CALL THE INQUIRY
038500       CALL "TMTLSTAT" USING BASE, VIEW-COMAREA,
038600         SRF-MPLTINFO-COMPANY, SRF-SPOOL-PRT-NO,
038700         DUMMY-CODE-PARM, LANGUAGE-PARMS
038800
038900*------- SWITCH BACK TO OLD FORMFILE
039000       MOVE "O"                      TO   CSF-MODE
039100       PERFORM 9999-CSWITCHF
039200
039300     END-IF.
           MOVE SAVE-LASTKEY TO VIEW-LASTKEY.
039400
039500**************************************************************
039600**************************************************************
039700**************************************************************
039800
       9999-CSWITCHF.
      * DUMMY ON AS/400

       9999-OPEN-STUFF.
           OPEN I-O DISPLAY-FILE.

       9999-CLOSE-STUFF.
           CLOSE DISPLAY-FILE.

040000 COPY HCATREAD     IN COPYLIB.
040100 COPY DISPCALL     IN COPYLIB.
040200 COPY DISPCAL2     IN COPYLIB.
040300 COPY SCRNCALL     IN COPYLIB.
       9999-GETBUFFER-1.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC TO DE-FIELDS-1.

       9999-PUTBUFFER-1.
           MOVE DE-FIELDS-1 TO DISPLAY-REC.

       9999-SETERROR-1.
           MOVE B"1"            TO IND (99).
           MOVE B"1"            TO IND (FIELD-NUMBER).
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER  TO DE-MESSAGE-LINE-1.
           MOVE DE-FIELDS-1     TO DISPLAY-REC.

       9999-DO-SCREEN-1.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 9989-WS-X.

